{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07358","headline":"李侍御河北使回至东京相访 · 刘长卿","name":"李侍御河北使回至东京相访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人南台秀，夙擅中朝美。\n拥传从北来，飞霜日千里。\n贫居幸相访，顾我柴门里。\n却讶绣衣人，仍交布衣士。\n王程遽尔迫，别恋从此始。\n浊酒未暇斟，清文颇垂示。\n回瞻骢马速，但见行尘起。\n日暮汀洲寒，春风渡流水。\n草色官道边，桃花御沟里。\n天涯一鸟夕，惆怅知何已。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}